    },
    {
      "claim": "L4 steroid solubility records show low aqueous solubility (diosgenin 0.95 µg/mL; progesterone 8–12 µg/mL), supporting solubility-limited absorption; high Caco-2 permeability for testosterone/dexamethasone indicates permeability is not the main barrier, but does not establish F ≥ 20% because first-pass metabolism and low solubility remain.",
